<http://data.silknow.org/object/82b0eba9-d4d5-34a0-a7a7-5f809e47e056/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "At the center top is a wreath, worked in purl, spangles, and metallic yarn, bearing the date; flanked by the initials \"JS\" in floral lettering. Beneath this is an urn with a medallion bearing the words \"Rosin Linden\". Beneath this is the scene of a funerary obelisk on a mound with a weeping willow tree. Various naturalistic plants and flowers plus and overturned cornucopia, a basket of flowers and other symbols, each suspended by a bow occupy the surrounding field in loose rows. Polychrome floss silk yarns mainly in satin stitch on a white silk field. Slightly soiled. Lined with a tan linen gauze."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/82b0eba9-d4d5-34a0-a7a7-5f809e47e056> .

<http://data.silknow.org/object/82b0eba9-d4d5-34a0-a7a7-5f809e47e056/domain/1>
